# debug.keystore is COMMITTED on purpose: it is the single shared debug signing key (standard
# Android debug password/alias), so debug builds from every machine and from CI always update
# in place instead of failing with "signatures do not match". Only RELEASE keys are secret.
debug.keystore.base64
my-upload-key.jks
*.jks
*.keystore
!debug.keystore
keystore/*.jks
*-debug.log

